TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange, 10 cells, 10 shifts

SOLUTION 0  Influent
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp true
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -time_step 1
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Na Ca Cl
    -alkalinity true

END
